## Simulator Changes Since m1 (not ISA changes)

The ISA is unchanged. The following simulator work was done after m1:

| Change | Detail |
|--------|--------|
| Datapath view | The live site now shows each instruction moving through IF, ID, EX, MEM and WB, one clock cycle at a time (Step) or continuously (Run) |
| Pipeline state | Control signals, register file (with Sesotho names), data memory and statistics (cycles, instructions, CPI, stalls, flushes) update as the program runs |
| Halt detection | A run ends cleanly on a self-branch or at the end of the program |
| Assembler | Unit tests added: 29 assembler tests, 122 across the project |

